5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I worry that making costs visible will break the quiet trust that lets newcomers drift in.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I need to know what the next treasurer actually faces. Two people quit in three years.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The same dozen faces do everything while others pay the same. I want to see the real split.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,People hesitate to commit now. I want to understand why the evenings feel so heavy.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,We can't guess the fee again. I need to know what we can actually count on coming in.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, guessing is dangerous. If we set it wrong, the trust breaks.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, trust doesn't pay the bills. I need to see the workload before we commit.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, workload is part of it, but I need to see who is actually showing up.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, showing up is the problem. I want to know why people are pulling back.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, pulling back means less money. I need to verify the income side, not just the mood.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check the taster forms and the sign-in sheets. I need to see the drift.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the treasurer's hours and the bank statements. I need to see the burden.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will check the sign-in sheets and the rota. I need to see the imbalance.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the weekday turnout and the winter social notes. I need to see the hesitation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will check the ledger and the mid-year sign-ups. I need to see the real costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
