35,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The taster forms say people won't commit to a whole year. The sign-in sheets show a quarter do everything.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,Chasing individual payments took six hours a month. A yearly collection took one. The bank statements show reminders are a nightmare.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The rota confirms it. The same nine people set up and lock up. They are also the top attendees.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,Turnout fell by a third after the summer door charge. The quiet members say they feel uneasy about the cost per visit.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"The ledger shows seventy percent of costs are fixed, like hall hire. Mid-year joiners needed hand-worked calculations.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, fixed costs mean the fee can't just be per event. But the taster forms show fear of commitment.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, fear of commitment is why we need a simple yearly collection. Chasing individual events is unsustainable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, simple is good, but if the same nine people carry the work, a flat fee feels unfair to them.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, if we charge per event, the quiet members will stop coming. The hesitation is already there.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, but if we don't charge per event, the fixed costs eat the budget. We need a base that covers the hall.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Takumi, a base fee covers the hall, but it might scare off the tasters who want to drift in.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, a base fee is the only way to keep the treasurer sane. I can't do six hours of chasing again.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Benjamin, I agree on the treasurer. But we need to acknowledge the imbalance. The nine people are doing double duty.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, acknowledging it doesn't fix the hesitation. If the fee feels like a penalty for not coming, they won't come.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Shunichi, the fee isn't a penalty. It's the cost of keeping the door open. We need to be clear about that.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I worry that any visible structure will break the drift. But the taster forms are clear.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am done. The workload data is decisive. We need a system that minimizes chasing.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I am done. The imbalance is real, but the treasurer's burden is worse.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I am done. The hesitation is real, but the fixed costs are real too.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Takumi,,I am done. The ledger is clear. We need a base that covers the fixed costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
